249	/**
250	 * Publish the current draft: flip the Site to PUBLISHING and enqueue a
251	 * SITE_PUBLISH job. The worker renders the bundle and writes it atomically into
252	 * `/var/www/<slug>.<base>`; only the worker may set PUBLISHED, and only on proof.
